  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Carlos. Your identity is verified.\n\nI found tonight's order, Q-7401 from Taqueria Luz. It was picked up at 6:44 PM and handed to you at 7:01 PM. The order includes carne asada tacos, elote, and agua fresca, and the elote was charged at $5.50. The courier's record shows the handoff was completed, and I can confirm the elote was not refunded earlier.\n\nSince the elote is missing, you can choose one of these options:\n\n1. **Refund of $5.50** to your Visa ending in 4242. This goes back to your original payment method.\n2. **Account credit of $6.60** ($5.50 plus 20%), usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
