   "text": "Your refund is done. I refunded $5.50 for the elote on order Q-7401 to your Visa ending in 4242. It should appear within 3 to 5 business days.\n\nTo answer your question: order 7388 is not from tonight. It was placed on October 17, a week ago, and it also had an elote. Its delivery was completed and recorded a week ago, so I can't add a missing-item claim to it now. Claims must be reported within 48 hours of delivery. Tonight's order is Q-7401."
  },
